keywords Teleport, Portal, Teleport: Stormwind, Teleport: Ironforge, Teleport: Darnassus, Portal: Stormwind, Portal: Ironforge, Portal: Darnassus, Larimaine Purdue, Milstaff Stormeye, Elissa Dumas, Portal Trainer, Rune of Teleportation, Rune of Portals, reagent vendor, Mage, class spell
reward spell 3561 "Teleport: Stormwind"
reward spell 3562 "Teleport: Ironforge"
